{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日流傳一段長約19秒的影片，有網民指在觀塘連鎖便利店購入盒裝鮮奶，飲用一啖後隨即出現腸胃不適腹瀉，後來發現貨架上多盒鮮奶疑已過期多時。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-17h52m50s091.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026CrtR728oZL1786356461.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-17h52m50s091.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">事主指當天早上飲用購入的鮮奶後便感到身體不適，直言：「今朝飲咗一啖已屙到X街」，影片所見，畫面顯示貨架上多盒鮮奶飲品，包裝上記錄的日期均為7月中至下旬（如7月18日、21日及25日等），事主指：「過期3個星期仲賣係咩事」。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">事主事後補充，已收到該便利店的回覆，又整理了出事時間線，「成個時間線係今朝9點左右買左2盒奶，09:20 飲左啖發現變壞 之後開始唔舒服肚屙，10:23 拎番第二盒過期奶落去拍片同職員理論嘅時候，店員除咗對唔住 就係馬上收走左我盒奶，果刻真係無報到食環 因為真係第一次唔識處理。」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"771652614_17941170528281009_2275909754310991242_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026YXVN5sTcTl1786414240.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"771652614_17941170528281009_2275909754310991242_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">貼文隨即引來廣大網民熱議，不少人對連鎖便利店出現長時間過期的貨品感到震驚，留言指：「CXS 成2個星期」、「下 咁過份！ 好唔OK喎」、「癲！仲要過咗咁耐，唔咪一兩日喎！！」，更有網民無奈揶揄該盒鮮奶簡直是「便秘之選」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-11-10h10m53s208.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026bOV4wD1Wdz1786414343.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-11-10h10m53s208.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T02:40:05.234324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":434,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}